  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Rending Fury",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Ultimate Combat",
    "definition_raw": "You easily tear your enemies limb from limb with your natural attacks.\n\nPrerequisite: Base attack bonus +6, rend special attack.\n\nBenefit: You deal rend damage if you hit with half the normal natural attacks your rend requires.\n\nFor example, a troll that has this feat can rend when it hits with one claw attack, while a girallon that has this feat must hit one target with two claw attacks to rend. You can only make this rend attack once per round.",
